Temperatures: 1 data track, 0.9 seconds, analysis mode.
Three days of noon temperatures.
Track temps: 3 tones from 0.0 to 0.9 seconds. Pitch follows temp, 400 to 1400 Hz; time follows day.
In temps, the highest pitch, 1400 Hz, is at 0.3 seconds (row 1); the lowest, 400 Hz, at 0.7 seconds (row 2).
